DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings you the be
 st stand up comedians from all over the country and this week with have a 
 special end of year comedy showcase!!\n\nGame Over is a celebration of the
  end of the year. Maybe your glad it's over or maybe it was your best one 
 yet but we can all get together to laugh at some of the chaos of the last 
 365 days.\n\nFeaturing a group of your favorite local and regional comedia
 ns in the RAD Comedy Lounge\n\nages 18+\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTi
 ckets $15 advance\, $18 day of
